---
Run the provider-side server.

Fronts an OpenAI-compatible upstream behind SomaPay-authorized `/v1/chat/completions`. Backends today: openrouter, vast.

Usage: soma inference serve [OPTIONS] --config <CONFIG>

Options:
      --config <CONFIG>
          Path to the provider TOML config (carries the model catalog + backend selection — no chain config)

      --address <ADDRESS>
          Address whose key signs both on-chain ops and HTTP vouchers. Defaults to the wallet's active address

      --client <CLIENT>
          Path to the soma client config (defaults to ~/.soma/client.yaml)

      --soma-home <SOMA_HOME>
          Soma home (for the per-channel provider ledger). Defaults to ~/.soma

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

EXAMPLE:
    soma inference serve --config provider.toml
